{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/combat_sample.gif?t=1745593757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deck of Stabs</strong> is a cutesy roguelike deckbuilder where <i>every single card is a weapon</i>. No shields, no spells\u2014just pure stab energy. Build a deck of nothing but brutal, beautiful, pixel-art weaponry and unleash it on everything that stands in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/character_selection.gif?t=1745593757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from <strong>five unique stab-happy heroes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steelhand</strong> \u2013 A battle-hardened warrior who crushes enemies with swipes and stuns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bladedancer</strong> \u2013 A flurry of fast, cheap attacks with razor-sharp precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hexrazor</strong> \u2013 A twisted sorcerer who curses foes and stabs corpses to fuel unholy power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Runecutter</strong> \u2013 A barrage of ancient shards that unleash explosive magical power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zerker</strong> \u2013 A bloodthirsty little rage-a-holic who gets stronger with every kill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/card_selection.gif?t=1745593757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you play, you\u2019ll build a personalized deck of weapon cards, creating powerful combos that evolve with each run. <strong>Level up</strong> to gain unique passive skills and character perks. <strong>Find items and treasures</strong> that grant special buffs, unlock synergies, and stack into devastating chains of attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/gameplay_loop.gif?t=1745593757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its charming pixel art, fast-paced combat, and pure-stab mechanics, <i>Deck of Stabs</i> offers a fresh twist on the roguelike deckbuilder genre. Every run is a new opportunity to sharpen your deck, stab smarter, and maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014become the ultimate stabber.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3658250?t=1745593757","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3658250?t=1745593757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/f6778d5d7ebaffece2e8a6c230e7051c9ca95b85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745593757","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/f6778d5d7ebaffece2e8a6c230e7051c9ca95b85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745593757","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/combat_sample.gif?t=1745593757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deck of Stabs</strong> is a cutesy roguelike deckbuilder where <i>every single card is a weapon</i>. No shields, no spells\u2014just pure stab energy. Build a deck of nothing but brutal, beautiful, pixel-art weaponry and unleash it on everything that stands in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/character_selection.gif?t=1745593757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from <strong>five unique stab-happy heroes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steelhand</strong> \u2013 A battle-hardened warrior who crushes enemies with swipes and stuns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bladedancer</strong> \u2013 A flurry of fast, cheap attacks with razor-sharp precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hexrazor</strong> \u2013 A twisted sorcerer who curses foes and stabs corpses to fuel unholy power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Runecutter</strong> \u2013 A barrage of ancient shards that unleash explosive magical power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zerker</strong> \u2013 A bloodthirsty little rage-a-holic who gets stronger with every kill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/card_selection.gif?t=1745593757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you play, you\u2019ll build a personalized deck of weapon cards, creating powerful combos that evolve with each run. <strong>Level up</strong> to gain unique passive skills and character perks. <strong>Find items and treasures</strong> that grant special buffs, unlock synergies, and stack into devastating chains of attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/extras/gameplay_loop.gif?t=1745593757\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its charming pixel art, fast-paced combat, and pure-stab mechanics, <i>Deck of Stabs</i> offers a fresh twist on the roguelike deckbuilder genre. Every run is a new opportunity to sharpen your deck, stab smarter, and maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014become the ultimate stabber.</p>","developers":["RetroAction Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658250/e95d468bdf273e3985cb57d58b76ad7351e37658/h